p,attribution,audio,mp3,44k,stereo,CBR", "upload_num_scores" : 18, "file_page_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/files/BOCrew/22904", "user_real_name" : "Bocrew", "artist_page_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/people/BOCrew", "license_logo_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/ccskins/shared/images/lics/small-by-3.png", "license_url" : "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/", "license_name" : "Attribution (3.0)", "upload_date_format" : "Tue, Sep 29, 2009 @ 12:42 AM", "qrank" : 86, "files" : [{"file_id" : 26088, "file_upload" : 22904, "file_name" : "BOCrew_-_BECKFORDS_THE_BOCREW.mp3", "file_nicname" : "mp3", "file_format_info" : {"media-type" : "audio", "format-name" : "audio-mp3-mp3", "default-ext" : "mp3", "mime_type" : "audio/mpeg", "sr" : "44k", "ch" : "stereo", "ps" : "2:46", "br" : "CBR"}, "file_extra" : {"sha1" : "XZAL7NAGM5BBBKVE2FUYG2SU34KG56T6"}, "file_filesize" : " (3.81MB)", "file_order" : 0, "file_is_remote" : 0, "file_num_download" : 0, "download_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/content/BOCrew/BOCrew_-_BECKFORDS_THE_BOCREW.mp3", "local_path" : "/var/www/ccmixter/content/BOCrew/BOCrew_-_BECKFORDS_THE_BOCREW.mp3", "file_rawsize" : 3990301}], "upload_description_plain" : "The little story\r\n\r\nat the begining we posted this instrumental under the name of\r\n\"Jess Beat 07\" it used a sample\r\nfrom the Great Kaer Trouz\r\n\r\n\"Deflated & Alone'\r\n\r\nThe trak was moderated i think\r\nbecause, it wasn't a fully RMX\r\n\r\nBut our homie Beckfords download it\r\nand he made an incredible thing on it\r\n\r\nThank Homie\r\n\r\nmix BOCrew & Beckfords\r\nVocal : Beckfords\r\nBackground Vocal : Kaer Trouz\r\nBass line ThedeepR\r\n\r\nPeace to Kaer Trouz, the sample is short but we'll try to make a full mix next time", "upload_description_html" : "The little story<br />\r\n<br />\r\nat the begining we posted this instrumental under the name of<br />\r\n&#8220;Jess Beat 07&#8221; it used a sample<br />\r\nfrom the Great Kaer Trouz<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&#8220;Deflated & Alone&#8217;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe trak was moderated i think<br />\r\nbecause, it wasn&#8217;t a fully RMX<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut our homie Beckfords download it<br />\r\nand he made an incredible thing on it<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThank Homie<br />\r\n<br />\r\nmix BOCrew & Beckfords<br />\r\nVocal : Beckfords<br />\r\nBackground Vocal : Kaer Trouz<br />\r\nBass line ThedeepR<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPeace to Kaer Trouz, the sample is short but we&#8217;ll try to make a full mix next time"},{"upload_id" : 21090, "upload_name" : "Jhonblack - Wayo Wayo", "upload_extra" : {"usertags" : "beach,caribe,dance,dancehall,dembow,latin,party,raggamuffin,reggae", "ccud" : "acappella,media,bpm_100_105,trackback,in_video", "systags" : "attribution,audio,mp3,44k,stereo,CBR,audio,mp3,44k,stereo,CBR", "featuring" : "", "bpm" : 100, "relative_dir" : "content/andrewfranco", "nsfw" : false, "last_op" : "add", "num_reviews" : 2}, "user_name" : "andrewfranco", "upload_tags" : ",acappella,media,bpm_100_105,trackback,in_video,rough_mix,attribution,audio,mp3,44k,stereo,CBR,beach,caribe,dance,dancehall,dembow,latin,party,raggamuffin,reggae,", "upload_num_scores" : 18, "file_page_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/files/andrewfranco/21090", "user_real_name" : "Andres Franco", "artist_page_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/people/andrewfranco", "license_logo_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/ccskins/shared/images/lics/small-by-3.png", "license_url" : "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/", "license_name" : "Attribution (3.0)", "upload_date_format" : "Thu, Jun 4, 2009 @ 3:48 PM", "qrank" : 76, "files" : [{"file_id" : 23604, "file_upload" : 21090, "file_name" : "andrewfranco_-_Jhonblack_-_Wayo_Wayo.mp3", "file_nicname" : "mp3", "file_format_info" : {"media-type" : "audio", "format-name" : "audio-mp3-mp3", "default-ext" : "mp3", "mime_type" : "audio/mpeg", "sr" : "44k", "ch" : "stereo", "ps" : "3:46", "br" : "CBR"}, "file_extra" : {"sha1" : "XXJCJ6EN6NDFHD3ISLVRZNL7UZ5RXEIT"}, "file_filesize" : " (8.61MB)", "file_order" : 0